94773564094_8430499586268792863_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aIfZYpBk08kQ7kNvwEaWiwe&_nc_oc=AdqWRuEZqwHN_1uFmAUb_ZK6sO9t_LuACBfpbPrcO4fq3tOw8MLkAtbuguRzvzF8AOI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3fYa3B0rgC0gb_Dmn7K89a2meEVa9zRAGrdmwA0BIxdQ&oe=69F36457"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "JJ_keyart_landscape_01.png", "id": "895140982980720", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619098_895140986314053_4158398188561500219_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_Ij3wucYCdwQ7kNvwERkEEW&_nc_oc=Adr_J0-9WQ8OcUJUn_HFRM6YYNK391JS-Rqq8odXZr8CcLWjBy1GXxzoLJbPYVEUMW4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0UgmbENhhpqeEGa2N4pK-0DqvIGpOM95xZnoLBV4qkHg&oe=69F35212"}, "display_name": "Jank Jumpers", "keywords": ["climb", "obby", "mountain", "obstacle", "peak"], "long_description": "**Can you reach the top?**\n\nWelcome to **Jank Jumpers, a co-op VR obby** that'll have you making death defying leaps to summit massive floating crags. Team up with friends and work together to discover the path up!\n{732125892790746}\n\n\n# Explore Hidden Routes\nEach level brings new challenges: risky shortcuts, moving hazards, and momentum-based puzzles that reward creativity as much as precision. Discover hangout spots and more secrets along the way.\n{899609659683336}\n\n\n# The Jank Jump\nMaster the Jank Jump and soar to improbable heights and across impossible distances. It will take some practice...\n{697403156562917}\n\n# Reach the top\nMake the climb and the golden idol will be waiting for you at the summit. Earn stars for each crag you complete.\n{4168845696665567}\n\nJump. Jank. Fall. Laugh \u2014 then do it all over again.\n\nSee you at the top.", "short_description": "Jank your way up massive crags"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.luckyjuicebox.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publis